  "description": "Lexerow is a backend dotnet library to process very easily datarows and cells in Excel files. You can for example detect empty cell in a column and set a specific value.",
  "id": "Lexerow",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-01-10T16:02:23.823Z",
